WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:05.679
Imagine a world where anyone can learn the skills that work asks for.

00:00:05.979 --> 00:00:06.922
And prove them.

00:00:07.399 --> 00:00:09.275
That is what we are building.

00:00:10.408 --> 00:00:12.634
Most training ends when the slides end.

00:00:12.934 --> 00:00:15.381
We think it should end when you can do the work.

00:00:16.478 --> 00:00:19.022
So every course is built the same way.

00:00:19.322 --> 00:00:20.704
Short video lessons.

00:00:21.004 --> 00:00:24.169
Labs you run yourself, with a guide for every step.

00:00:24.535 --> 00:00:28.402
An assistant inside the lesson, that answers from the course.

00:00:28.723 --> 00:00:30.386
A quiz in every module.

00:00:30.686 --> 00:00:32.188
And a certificate at the end.

00:00:33.336 --> 00:00:35.162
Prepare for a certification.

00:00:35.462 --> 00:00:37.047
Build a real project.

00:00:37.347 --> 00:00:39.915
Or learn one useful skill in an hour.

00:00:41.025 --> 00:00:45.524
For Claude, there is a guide and a practice exam for every certification.

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:48.793
For your team, we go further.

00:00:49.093 --> 00:00:52.959
We learn your work, build the course around it, and teach it live.

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:57.582
We can even set up a learning platform for your company.

00:00:57.882 --> 00:00:58.945
Your courses.

00:00:59.245 --> 00:01:00.247
Your people.

00:01:00.547 --> 00:01:01.751
Your name.

00:01:02.998 --> 00:01:06.161
And if you want to see it work first, we build a prototype.

00:01:07.311 --> 00:01:09.954
Every month, there is the AI Weekend.

00:01:10.254 --> 00:01:11.515
Two live sessions.

00:01:11.815 --> 00:01:14.338
Six working demos, built in front of you.

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:16.143
Train.

00:01:16.447 --> 00:01:17.191
Innovate.

00:01:17.491 --> 00:01:18.133
Build.

00:01:18.685 --> 00:01:20.697
Start with a preview lesson.

00:01:20.997 --> 00:01:22.666
Nothing to sign up for.
